              <p>
                This publication is intended to help you understand how personal information you provide to WAStays is collected and used directly or indirectly through the use of our website and platform, so you may make informed decisions when using our services.
              </p>

              <div class="p-6 bg-[#fdfbf7] border border-neutral-border/50 my-6 text-left">
