                <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm">
                  <li><strong class="text-brand-primary font-bold">Organiser:</strong> An entity with which WAStays has an established relationship, including hotel operators, property owners, or business users managing bookings and guest communications through WAStays.</li>
                  <li><strong class="text-brand-primary font-bold">Attendee:</strong> Any individual who signs up for bookings, reservations, stay-related registrations, or who is included as a contact in an Organiser's account.</li>
                  <li><strong class="text-brand-primary font-bold">Visitor:</strong> Anyone visiting our public website at www.wastays.com.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>

              <p>
                Any information stored on the WAStays platform is treated as confidential. All information is stored securely and is accessed by authorized personnel only. WAStays implements and maintains appropriate technical, security and organisational measures to protect personal data against unauthorized or unlawful processing and use, and against accidental loss, destruction, damage, theft or disclosure.
              </p>

              <p>
