                WAStays collects and uses your personal information to operate and deliver the services you have requested. When you sign up with WAStays, you may be enrolled in service-related communications and, where applicable, newsletters about new features and useful tips. If you do not wish to receive marketing communications, you may unsubscribe using the links provided in those messages. Even after unsubscribing from marketing communications, you may continue to receive emails related to your use of the WAStays website and platform.
              </p>
              <p>
                WAStays may also use your personally identifiable information to inform you of other products or services available from WAStays and its affiliates, and may contact you through surveys to conduct research about your opinion of current services or potential new services. WAStays may communicate with you through email and messages posted within the platform.
              </p>
              <p>
                Information about your computer hardware and software may also be collected automatically by WAStays. This information can include your IP address, browser type, domain names, access times, pages visited, features used, and referring website addresses. This information is used for the operation of the service, to maintain quality of the service, and to provide general statistics regarding use of WAStays.
              </p>
              <p>
                WAStays may, from time to time, contact you on behalf of carefully selected business partners about a particular offering that we believe may be of interest to you. In those cases, your unique personally identifiable information is not transferred to the third party. WAStays may also share data with trusted partners to help us perform statistical analysis, send email or postal mail, provide customer support, process payments, or arrange related service delivery. All such third parties are prohibited from using your personal information except to provide these services to WAStays, and they are required to maintain the confidentiality of your information.
              </p>
              <p>
                From time to time, WAStays may enter into strategic partnerships in which personal information may be provided to a carefully selected business partner, including in private-label, co-branded websites, or promotional web pages for which WAStays receives compensation. Any such partner may have its own privacy policy, which will govern use, handling and disclosure of your personal information once shared as described in this Privacy Policy.
              </p>
              <p>
                WAStays keeps track of the websites and pages our customers visit within WAStays in order to determine what services are the most popular. This data is used to deliver customized content and advertising within WAStays to customers whose behavior indicates that they are interested in a particular subject area.
              </p>
